                                                "sense_id": "ceb3b526-097c-3343-b169-5d7813e5893d",
                                                "text": "The most well-documented case of xenoglossy, however, concerned Swiss Medium Hélène Smith (1861-1929), who falsely claimed to speak the Martian language."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
